the complete taxonomy, finalize ADR 0100 and architecture/operator docs, and prove no removed production path is reachable.\n\n## Plan\n1. Build end-to-end fake Cloud/DC passes covering mixed success, transient recovery, long-delay deferral, permanent ticket failure, auth/provider stop, fuse open/reset, label-first create, restart, partial outcome, and delivery failure.\n2. Run the route census and runtime poison checks with the end-to-end suite. Keep bounded live probes optional operator evidence rather than a portable gate.\n3. Finalize ADR 0100 with retry ownership, failure taxonomy, fuse, containment, intentional deltas, expand/contract cutover, and rollback.\n4. Document planner -> coordinator -> adapter dependency direction, versioned output, operations guidance, and future adapter atomic-operation/retry obligations.\n5. Verify rollback re-observes remote state and never deletes successful Jira work.\n\n## Testing\nThe interface suite uses no external credentials and runs in every supported local/CI environment. ADR/doc index and route-census tests are mandatory.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Portable fake Cloud/DC suites cover every named outcome, fuse, create, restart, partial, and delivery scenario.\n- [ ] End-to-end tests require no external credential or CI-provider-specific trigger.\n- [ ] Route census and poison tests find no reachable removed fallback.\n- [ ] ADR 0100 records ownership, taxonomy, fuse, containment, intentional deltas, cutover, and no-delete rollback.\n- [ ] Architecture/operator docs define versioned outcomes and future adapter obligations.\n- [ ] ADR numbering, documentation index, and architecture links pass.\n\n## Out of scope\nOptional live probes do not gate completion.","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[{"path":"tests/interfaces/store/test_reconciler_coordinator.py","reason":"Portable credential-free Cloud/DC end-to-end coordinator validation."},{"path":"tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/mutate/test_coordinator_route_census.py","reason":"Final route census and poison checks."},{"path":"docs/adr/0100-reconciler-operation-coordination.md","reason":"Finalize retry, taxonomy, fuse, containment, cutover, and rollback decisions."},{"path":"docs/adr/README.md","reason":"Index ADR 0100."},{"path":"docs/architecture.md","reason":"Document planner/coordinator/adapter dependency direction and adapter obligations."}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[["depends_on","0f5d-2a24-91d2-4148"],["depends_on","b81b-8671-3c61-488f"],["parent","3350-90b1-2651-4c50"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":"3350-90b1-2651-4c50","parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":1,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":["rp03","coordinator","adr","tdd"],"ticket_id":"a735-052e-8eca-4aeb","ticket_type":"task","title":"RP-03 S5 T3 — Validate the complete coordinator and finalize ADR 0100","verify_commands":[{"command":"env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" .venv/bin/pytest -q tests/interfaces/store/test_reconciler_coordinator.py","dd_id":"AC1-AC2","dd_text":"Portable credential-free Cloud/DC end-to-end taxonomy and recovery"},{"command":"env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" .venv/bin/pytest -q tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/mutate/test_coordinator_route_census.py","dd_id":"AC3","dd_text":"Final route census and removed-fallback poison checks"},{"command":"env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" .venv/bin/pytest -q tests/unit/test_check_docs_index.py tests/scripts/test_check_adr_numbers.py","dd_id":"AC4-AC6","dd_text":"ADR, architecture, operator contract, numbering, and index integrity"}]},"source_event_uuids":["fbf103c9-1b5b-4d1e-904e-691b493d4a29","cd7ff42b-bb53-401a-8fdd-6b8d36ce0b1b","d318d83e-4c7a-4a1a-9b70-06f7b1270d53","f9f4ea38-11b5-4cf4-83b6-d356f3a444f9","8d733016-b7a8-4732-b77a-16a8784c9b6c"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1787030377288314001,"uuid":